---
import InternalLayout from '../../../../layouts/InternalLayout.astro';
---
<InternalLayout title="Angebot und Auftrag" description="Angebote für private Sachverständigenleistungen erstellen.">
<main class="pb-app">
  <header class="pb-heading"><div><a href="/intern/privatauftraege/">← Privatgutachten</a><p class="pb-eyebrow">ANGEBOT & AUFTRAG</p><h1 id="pb-title">Angebot anlegen</h1><p id="pb-identity">Die eigene Nummer wird beim ersten Speichern vergeben.</p></div><div class="pb-brands"><img src="/intern/assets/private-business/schuett-logo.jpg" alt="SV Büro Schütt" width="120" height="80"/><img src="/intern/assets/private-business/sv-netzwerk-de-logo.jpg" alt="SV-Netzwerk.de" width="96" height="62"/></div></header>
  <nav class="pb-tabs" aria-label="Angebot und Überführung"><button type="button" id="pb-tab-details" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Angebot / Auftrag bearbeiten</button><button type="button" id="pb-tab-convert" role="tab" aria-selected="false">In Auftrag überführen</button></nav>
  <p id="pb-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Maske wird geladen …</p>
  <section id="pb-convert-panel" class="pb-card" hidden><h2>Aus dem Angebot wird ein Auftrag</h2><p>Das Angebot behält seine Nummer. Der Auftrag erhält eine neue eigene Nummer; alle Unterlagen bleiben miteinander verknüpft.</p><label class="pb-check"><input type="checkbox" id="pb-confirmed"/> Die Beauftragung liegt vor.</label><button type="button" id="pb-convert" class="primary">Jetzt in Auftrag überführen</button><a id="pb-child-order" hidden>Bestehenden Auftrag öffnen</a></section>
  <div id="pb-details-panel" class="pb-layout"><form id="pb-form"><fieldset id="pb-fields">
    <section class="pb-card"><h2><span>01</span> Auftraggeber & Rechnungsadresse</h2><div class="pb-grid">
      <label>Kundentyp<select data-pb="customer_type"><option value="consumer">Verbraucher</option><option value="business">Unternehmen / beruflicher Auftrag</option></select></label><label>Firma<input data-pb="company" autocomplete="organization"/></label>
      <label>Vorname<input data-pb="first_name" autocomplete="given-name"/></label><label>Nachname<input data-pb="last_name" autocomplete="family-name"/></label>
      <label class="wide">Straße und Hausnummer<input data-pb="billing_street" autocomplete="address-line1"/></label><label>PLZ<input data-pb="billing_postcode" autocomplete="postal-code"/></label><label>Ort<input data-pb="billing_city" autocomplete="address-level2"/></label>
      <label>E-Mail<input data-pb="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"/></label><label>Telefon<input data-pb="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"/></label>
      <label>Mobilnummer<input data-pb="mobile" type="tel" autocomplete="mobile tel"/></label><label>Sonstige Nummer<input data-pb="other_phone" type="tel"/></label>
    </div></section>
    <section class="pb-card"><h2><span>02</span> Terminadresse & Leistung</h2><label class="pb-check"><input data-pb="site_same" type="checkbox" checked/> Terminadresse entspricht der Rechnungsadresse</label><div id="pb-site" class="pb-grid" hidden><label class="wide">Straße und Hausnummer vor Ort<input data-pb="site_street"/></label><label>PLZ vor Ort<input data-pb="site_postcode"/></label><label>Ort des Ortstermins<input data-pb="site_city"/></label></div><div class="pb-grid"><label>Ansprechpartner vor Ort<input data-pb="contact"/></label><label>Vorgesehener Termin<input data-pb="appointment" placeholder="Datum / Zeit oder nach Vereinbarung"/></label><label class="wide">Leistungsbeschreibung<textarea data-pb="scope" rows="5" placeholder="Was soll geprüft, begutachtet oder ausgearbeitet werden?"></textarea></label><label>Angebot gültig bis<input data-pb="valid_until" type="date"/></label><label>Geplante Arbeitsstunden<input data-pb="hours" type="number" min="0" step="0.25"/></label></div></section>
    <section class="pb-card"><h2><span>03</span> Anfahrt zum Ortstermin</h2><div class="pb-origins" role="group" aria-label="Startadresse"><label class="pb-check"><input type="radio" name="pb-origin" value="aalen" checked/> Aalen · Nordstraße 17</label><label class="pb-check"><input type="radio" name="pb-origin" value="werdohl"/> Werdohl · Feldstraße 108</label><label class="pb-check"><input type="radio" name="pb-origin" value="custom"/> Freie Startadresse</label></div><div id="pb-custom-origin" class="pb-grid" hidden><label class="wide">Startstraße und Hausnummer<input data-pb="origin_street"/></label><label>Start-PLZ<input data-pb="origin_postcode"/></label><label>Startort<input data-pb="origin_city"/></label></div><button type="button" id="pb-route">Fahrstrecke berechnen</button><p id="pb-route-state" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="hint">Ziel ist immer die tatsächliche Terminadresse. Strecke und Zeit werden für Hin- und Rückweg berechnet. Die einfachen Werte können auch manuell eingetragen oder angepasst werden.</p><div class="pb-grid"><label>Einfache Strecke (km)<input data-pb="oneway_km" type="number" min="0" step="0.1"/></label><label>Einfache Fahrzeit (Minuten)<input data-pb="oneway_minutes" type="number" min="0" step="1"/></label><label>Anzahl Ortstermine<input data-pb="visits" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="1"/></label></div><p id="pb-route-source" class="hint"></p></section>
    <section class="pb-card"><h2><span>04</span> Honorar & Konditionen</h2><div class="pb-grid"><label>Abrechnung<select data-pb="pricing"><option value="effort">Nach tatsächlichem Aufwand (Schätzung)</option><option value="flat">Vereinbarte Gesamtpauschale</option></select></label><label id="pb-flat">Pauschalhonorar netto (€)<input data-pb="flat_net" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>Begutachtung / Analyse netto (€/h)<input data-pb="hour_rate" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>Fahrtzeit netto (€/h)<input data-pb="travel_rate" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>KFZ-Kosten netto (€/km)<input data-pb="km_rate" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>Nebenkostenpauschale netto (€)<input data-pb="incidental" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label><label>Umsatzsteuer (%)<input data-pb="vat_rate" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01"/></label><label class="wide">Ergänzende Vereinbarungen<textarea data-pb="notes" rows="3"></textarea></label></div></section>
  </fieldset></form>
  <aside class="pb-card pb-summary"><p class="pb-eyebrow">KOSTENÜBERSICHT</p><h2>Transparent kalkuliert</h2><dl><div><dt>Arbeitsleistung</dt><dd id="pb-analysis">–</dd></div><div><dt>Fahrtzeit (hin & zurück)</dt><dd id="pb-travel">–</dd></div><div><dt>Kilometer (hin & zurück)</dt><dd id="pb-distance">–</dd></div><div><dt>Nebenkosten</dt><dd id="pb-incidental">–</dd></div><div><dt>Netto</dt><dd id="pb-net">–</dd></div><div><dt>Umsatzsteuer</dt><dd id="pb-vat">–</dd></div><div class="pb-gross"><dt>Gesamt brutto</dt><dd id="pb-gross">–</dd></div></dl><p id="pb-trip-summary" class="hint"></p><p id="pb-missing" class="hint"></p><p class="hint">Auftragsformular, Widerrufsbelehrung und Muster-Widerrufsformular entstehen mit jedem gespeicherten Stand. Unvollständige Angaben werden im PDF als Entwurf gekennzeichnet.</p><div id="pb-files"></div><button id="pb-retry-archive" type="button" hidden>Ablage erneut versuchen</button></aside></div>
  <footer class="pb-actions"><button type="button" id="pb-save" class="primary">Nur speichern</button><button type="button" id="pb-pdf">Als PDF herunterladen</button><button type="button" id="pb-print">Drucken</button><button type="button" id="pb-mail">Per E-Mail versenden</button><p id="pb-action-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></footer>
</main>
<dialog id="pb-preview"><div class="pb-dialog-toolbar"><strong>PDF-Unterlagen</strong><a id="pb-download-link" hidden>PDF herunterladen</a><button type="button" id="pb-print-frame">Druckdialog öffnen</button><button type="button" id="pb-preview-close">Schließen</button></div><p id="pb-preview-state" role="status"></p><iframe id="pb-pdf-frame" title="PDF-Vorschau"></iframe></dialog>
<dialog id="pb-mail-dialog"><form id="pb-mail-form"><h2>E-Mail prüfen und versenden</h2><p id="pb-mail-sender"></p><label>Empfänger<input id="pb-to" type="email" required/></label><label>Betreff<input id="pb-subject" required maxlength="300"/></label><label>Nachricht<textarea id="pb-body" rows="7" required></textarea></label><p>Anhänge: Angebot bzw. Auftrag, Auftragsformular, Widerrufsbelehrung mit Muster-Widerrufsformular.</p><p id="pb-mail-state" role="status"></p><div class="pb-dialog-toolbar"><button type="button" id="pb-mail-cancel">Abbrechen</button><button type="submit" id="pb-mail-send">Jetzt versenden</button><button type="button" id="pb-mail-status" hidden>Versandstatus prüfen</button></div></form></dialog>
<style is:global>
.pb-app{max-width:1500px;padding:28px;color:#183447}.pb-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:24px}.pb-heading a{color:#526d7c;text-decoration:none}.pb-heading h1{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.4rem);margin:.3rem 0}.pb-heading p{margin:.4rem 0}.pb-eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#ae7624}.pb-brands{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-shrink:0}.pb-brands img{object-fit:contain}.pb-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}.pb-app button,.pb-app a.pb-button,#pb-mail-dialog button,#pb-preview button{font:inherit;font-weight:650;padding:12px 17px;border:1px solid #b9c9d3;border-radius:8px;background:white;color:#183447;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}.pb-app button.primary,.pb-tabs [aria-selected=true]{background:#17394c;color:white;border-color:#17394c}.pb-app button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:wait}.pb-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;gap:22px;align-items:start}.pb-card{background:white;border:1px solid #dce5ea;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 3px 14px #19354908}.pb-card h2{font-size:1.13rem;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 20px}.pb-card h2>span{font-size:.8rem;color:#9c6d2a;background:#f7f2e9;border-radius:6px;padding:6px}.pb-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:14px}.pb-grid .wide{grid-column:1/-1}.pb-app label,#pb-mail-dialog label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}.pb-app input,.pb-app select,.pb-app textarea,#pb-mail-dialog input,#pb-mail-dialog textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #bdcdd7;border-radius:7px;background:#fcfdfe;color:#17394c;font:inherit}.pb-app input:focus,.pb-app textarea:focus,.pb-app select:focus{outline:2px solid #d7b87e;outline-offset:2px}.pb-app .pb-check{flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-weight:500}.pb-check input{width:auto;flex:none;margin-top:3px}.pb-origins{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.pb-app fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0;min-width:0}.pb-summary{position:sticky;top:20px}.pb-summary dl{margin:0}.pb-summary dl>div{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6edf0;font-size:.9rem}.pb-summary dt{color:#596f7c}.pb-summary dd{margin:0;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:650}.pb-summary .pb-gross{font-size:1.1rem;border:0;background:#edf4f5;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 10px;margin-top:10px}.pb-gross dt{color:#17394c}.pb-app .hint{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.55;color:#607784}.pb-actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:16px;background:#fffffff5;border:1px solid #dce5ea;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 -4px 20px #17394c0a}.pb-app [hidden],#pb-mail-dialog [hidden]{display:none!important}#pb-status{padding:12px 0;min-height:24px;color:#536d7c}#pb-status.error{color:#a02b27}#pb-files a{display:block;margin:9px 0;color:#22617a}#pb-preview{width:min(1100px,95vw);height:90vh;padding:16px;border:0;border-radius:12px}#pb-preview::backdrop,#pb-mail-dialog::backdrop{background:#142d4266}#pb-action-status{flex-basis:100%;margin:0;font-size:.9rem}#pb-action-status.error{color:#a02b27}#pb-preview [hidden]{display:none!important}#pb-download-link{padding:10px 16px;background:#17394c;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px}#pb-preview iframe{border:0;width:100%;height:calc(100% - 60px)}.pb-dialog-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:12px}.pb-dialog-toolbar strong{margin-right:auto}#pb-mail-dialog{width:min(650px,90vw);border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:26px}#pb-mail-form{display:grid;gap:14px}@media(max-width:1150px){.pb-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pb-summary{position:static}.pb-heading{flex-wrap:wrap}.pb-summary dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 25px}}@media(max-width:600px){.pb-app{padding:16px}.pb-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pb-grid .wide{grid-column:auto}.pb-summary dl{display:block}.pb-tabs{flex-direction:column}.pb-card{padding:18px}.pb-actions button{flex:1}.pb-brands{gap:12px}}
</style>
<script is:inline src="/intern/private-business.js?v=20261017-3"></script>
</InternalLayout>
